      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i think im in trouble. i was going through some old papers from my great-uncle and found this birth certificate that says i'm part of the Valerius-Kovacs line. i've never heard of it but the docs talk about how the whole branch was liquidated by the council in the 70s to hide the inheritance. i tried searching for the name but everything is coming up blank or redirected. is it possible they've actually scrubbed this from the internet? i feel like i'm being watched.",
